Vendoring note (Palworld-Server-Manager):
This directory is a vendored copy of `oozextract` v0.5.4
(https://github.com/lvlvllvlvllvlvl/oozextract), an MIT-licensed pure-Rust
Kraken / Mermaid / Selkie / Leviathan / LZNA / Bitknit decompressor. It is used
to decode Palworld `.sav` files compressed with Oodle (PlM / Kraken,
save_type=49). The upstream repository ships no LICENSE file despite declaring
`license = "MIT"`; the standard MIT text above is reproduced here with the
upstream author attribution for distribution-compliance. No source code was
modified from upstream v0.5.4 except for this Cargo.toml trim (rlib-only,
removed cli/unoodle bin, criterion bench, and optional cli/tokio/async/wasm
features) and the addition of this LICENSE-MIT file.
